ph-geo — data attribution
=========================

The bundled coordinate dataset (data/coords.json) is derived from the GeoNames
Philippines postal-code dump:

  https://download.geonames.org/export/zip/PH.zip

GeoNames data is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License
(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

  © GeoNames — https://www.geonames.org

Each city/municipality coordinate is a representative point computed as the mean
of the GeoNames postal-code points that map to that PSGC city/municipality (the
ZIP → cityMunCode join is reused from @ph-dev-utils/postal; names/provinces/
regions are joined from the PSA Q4 2024 PSGC via @ph-dev-utils/core). These are
approximate centroids for distance/proximity use — NOT official PSA centroids or
survey-grade coordinates. The transform is reproducible from scripts/build-data.mjs
over scripts/geonames-PH.txt.

Aqours retention and adaptation
==============================

